{'symbol': 'XOM', 'date': '2023-04-04 10:15:00', 'title': 'LINDE SIGNS AGREEMENT WITH EXXONMOBIL FOR CARBON DIOXIDE OFF-TAKE', 'text': "WOKING, UK / ACCESSWIRE / APRIL 4, 2023 / LINDE (NYSE:LIN) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS SIGNED A LONG-TERM AGREEMENT WITH EXXONMOBIL (NYSE:XOM) FOR THE OFF-TAKE OF CARBON DIOXIDE ASSOCIATED WITH LINDE'S NEW CLEAN HYDROGEN PRODUCTION IN BEAUMONT, TEXAS. LINDE PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED THAT IT WILL BUILD, OWN AND OPERATE AN ON-SITE COMPLEX TO SUPPLY CLEAN HYDROGEN AND NITROGEN TO OCI GLOBAL'S (EURONEXT: OCI) NEW WORLD-SCALE BLUE AMMONIA PLANT."}